---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Photo from "../components/Photo.astro";
import Drop from "../components/Drop.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/CtaBand.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Coulehan Plumbing LLC is an owner-operated plumbing company in Pittsburgh, PA. Jerry Coulehan is a Master Plumber. BBB accredited and a Google Verified Business."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow"><Drop size={16} /> About</p>
      <h1>Owner-operated. Jerry answers the work.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Coulehan Plumbing LLC is a small plumbing company in Pittsburgh, PA
        15226. Jerry Coulehan is the owner and a Master Plumber. The shop has
        been serving the community for over a decade.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 1rem">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          His posts sign off the same way, job after job: one call that does it
          all. Residential and commercial. He writes the jobs up himself, from
          a kitchen ceiling full of new PVC to a French drain in a wet basement.
        </p>
        <p>
          This page sticks to what is already public. A longer bio, the year the
          company opened, and a street address are not filled in, because they
          were not in the source material.
        </p>
        <h2>What checks out</h2>
        <div class="trust-grid" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr">
          <article class="trust-card">
            <h3>BBB accredited</h3>
            <p>
              The Facebook intro says the business is accredited with the Better
              Business Bureau. A profile link was not in the archive.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="trust-card">
            <h3>Google Verified Business</h3>
            <p>
              The same intro says the company is a Google Verified Business, and
              points to a short link.
            </p>
            <p><a href={site.google}>Open the Google link from Facebook</a></p>
          </article>
          <article class="trust-card">
            <h3>100% recommend</h3>
            <p>
              Facebook shows 100% recommend, from 80 reviews. Individual reviews
              are not quoted on this site. None were provided.
            </p>
            <p><a href={site.facebook}>Facebook page</a></p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <Photo
          class="about-logo"
          group="brand"
          id="logo"
          alt="Coulehan Plumbing logo: a blue water drop over crossed pipes, with the company name."
          sizes="280px"
        />
        <figure class="hero-photo" style="margin-top: 1rem">
          <Photo
            group="brand"
            id="cover"
            alt="Rear of the Coulehan Plumbing service truck, with the company name and blue drop logo."
            sizes="(min-width: 720px) 40vw, 100vw"
          />
          <figcaption>The service truck, from the Facebook cover photo.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <aside class="todo">
        <p>
          <strong>TODO — confirm with Jerry before this goes live.</strong>
        </p>
        <ul class="drop-list">
          <li>
            The Facebook intro contains “HP 04732”. It may be a registration or
            license number. It is not confirmed, so it is not shown anywhere on
            this site as a license.
          </li>
          <li>
            Hours. Facebook says “Always open.” The current website hours block
            says 8am–5pm and is broken. The current site also advertises
            24-hour emergency service. Which hours should the new site publish?
          </li>
          <li>
            Founding year. The current site says “over a decade.” The exact year
            is not in the source material.
          </li>
          <li>
            A short bio in Jerry’s own words, and whether he wants the Master
            Plumber line worded a specific way.
          </li>
          <li>Street address. Facebook only gives Pittsburgh, PA 15226-1120.</li>
          <li>BBB profile URL, if he wants the badge linked.</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand />
</Base>
